### Test Gotaglio API Endpoints

# Base URL - adjust port if needed
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Test root endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### Test infer endpoint with mock data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/infer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case": {
    "id": "test-case-123",
    "description": "Test case for inference",
    "data": "sample input data"
  },
  "turn": 1
}

###

### Test infer endpoint with different turn
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/infer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case": {
    "id": "test-case-456",
    "description": "Another test case",
    "metadata": {
      "source": "test"
    }
  },
  "turn": 3
}

###

### Test validate endpoint with valid data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "case": {
    "id": "validation-test",
    "type": "test"
  },
  "some_field": "some_value",
  "nested": {
    "property": "value"
  }
}

###

### Test validate endpoint with missing case field (should return error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "some_field": "some_value",
  "no_case_field": true
}

###

### Test validate endpoint with empty data (should return error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{}
